    <div class="container">
        
        <!-- About Me Section -->
        <section>
            <h2>About Your Guide</h2>
            <p>Hello! I am Kalkidan. Born and raised right here in <strong>Addis Ababa</strong>, I know the vibrant soul of our capital inside and out. Whether you want to navigate the bustling alleys of Merkato, experience a traditional Ethiopian coffee ceremony, taste local foods, or explore historic landmarks across Ethiopia, I am here to make your trip safe, seamless, and deeply memorable.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- Services Section -->
        <section>
            <h2>What Services I Provide</h2>
            <ul class="services-list">
                <li>✨ <strong>Addis Ababa City Tours:</strong> Fully guided tours of parks, museums, churches, and local hidden gems.</li>
                <li>☕ <strong>Cultural Experiences:</strong> Authentic traditional food tours, traditional coffee ceremonies, and cultural dance evenings.</li>
                <li>🌃 <strong>Nightlife Tours:</strong> Experience the energetic and safe nightlife of Addis Ababa with a local expert.</li>
                <li>🏨 <strong>Logistics & Bookings:</strong> Assistance with affordable hotel bookings and reliable airport pickups.</li>
                <li>🗺️ <strong>Custom Ethiopian Trips:</strong> Tailored itineraries exploring historic, religious, and scenic regions outside the capital.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Destinations Section -->
        <section>
            <h2>Explore Addis Ababa & Beyond</h2>
            <p>Here are some of the incredible places we can explore together:</p>
            <ul class="destinations-list">
                <li><strong>Addis Ababa Highlights:</strong> Entoto Park, Unity Park, National Museum (Lucy), and Mercato (the largest open-air market in Africa).</li>
                <li><strong>Historic & Religious Sites in Ethiopia:</strong> Lalibela rock-hewn churches, historic Gondar castles, the ancient city of Axum, and Harar Jugol.</li>
                <li><strong>Scenic & Cultural Wonders:</strong> The Rift Valley lakes, Simien Mountains, and diverse cultural communities across the country.</li>
            </ul>

            <!-- Photo Gallery with Descriptions -->
            <div class="gallery">
