                        <p>Experience the warmth, aroma, and rich tradition of brewing authentic Ethiopian coffee from raw beans to the final cup.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555396273-367ea4eb4db5" alt="Traditional Food">
