                        <p>Taste the incredible spices of Injera, Doro Wat, and local culinary delights in authentic settings.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542224566-6e85f2e6772f" alt="Entoto Park">
