                <div class="gallery-card">
                    <img src="https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/16/04/67/18/merkato-panoramic-shot.jpg?w=900&h=500&s=1" alt="Merkato">
                    <div class="gallery-content">
                        <h3>Merkato Market</h3>
                        <p>Dive into the vibrant hustle and bustle of Africa's largest open-air marketplace with a knowledgeable local guide.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516450360452-9312f5e86fc7" alt="Nightlife">
                    <div class="gallery-content">
                        <h3>Addis Ababa Nightlife</h3>
                        <p>Discover lively music venues, traditional live bands, and modern lounges after dark.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="gallery-card">
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568605117036-5fe5e7bab0b7" alt="Historical Museums & Parks">
                    <div class="gallery-content">
                        <h3>Unity Park & Museums</h3>
                        <p>Explore Ethiopia's rich history, heritage sites, and national treasures, including Lucy at the National Museum.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
